{'symbol': 'GILD', 'date': '2021-12-16 18:00:00', 'title': 'DAIICHI SANKYO AUTHORIZES THE FIRST YESCARTA® (AXICABTAGENE CILOLEUCEL) CAR T-CELL THERAPY TREATMENT SITE IN JAPAN', 'text': 'SANTA MONICA, CALIF. & TOKYO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--KITE, A GILEAD COMPANY, AND DAIICHI SANKYO COMPANY, LIMITED (HEREAFTER, DAIICHI SANKYO) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT YESCARTA® (AXICABTAGENE CILOLEUCEL), A CHIMERIC ANTIGEN RECEPTOR (CAR) T-CELL THERAPY, WILL BE AVAILABLE TO PATIENTS WITH RELAPSED OR REFRACTORY LARGE B-CELL LYMPHOMAS IN JAPAN THROUGH THE FIRST TREATMENT CENTER NOW AUTHORIZED BY DAIICHI SANKYO. KITE AND DAIICHI SANKYO WILL ALSO BUILD ON THE EXCLUSIVE LICENSING DEAL FOR COMMERCIALIZATION RIG'}